sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Pengguna
  participant FE as React
  participant API as Express
  participant DB as MySQL

  U->>FE: isi nama, email, HP, password
  FE->>FE: cek konfirmasi password
  FE->>API: POST /api/mp/auth/register
  API->>DB: cek email unik
  API->>DB: INSERT users + bcrypt.hash
  API-->>FE: Set-Cookie JWT httpOnly
  FE-->>U: arahkan onboarding profil
